sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as App(挂载)
    participant Sched as useDcaScheduler
    participant Store as useDcaStore
    participant Svc as dcaService
    participant Repo as dcaRepository
    participant Inv as investmentRepository
    participant Acc as accountRepository
    participant Plan as DcaPlan(DB)
    participant Hold as FUND持仓(DB)
    participant Rec as DcaRecord(DB)

    App->>Sched: 挂载(启动) + 监听 visibilitychange/focus(前台)
    Sched->>Store: runDueDeductions()
    Store->>Svc: runDueDeductions(today)
    Svc->>Repo: getEnabledDuePlans(today)
    Note over Svc,Repo: 条件 enabled && nextDeductionDate <= today
    Repo-->>Svc: DcaPlan[] (到期计划)

    loop 每个到期计划(仅补记一次)
        Svc->>Plan: 读取 amount / targetInvestmentId / fundCode / frequency
        alt deductionMode == MANUAL_CONFIRM
            Svc-->>Store: 仅记入"待确认"列表(不写记录)
        else AUTO(默认)
            Svc->>Rec: createRecord(planId, accountId, targetInvestmentId, amount, basisDate=nextDeductionDate)
            Svc->>Inv: applyDcaContribution(targetId, amount)
            Note over Inv: marketValue += amount; costAmount += amount; holdingProfit 口径不变
            Inv->>Acc: recalcBalanceFromHoldings(accountId)
            Note over Acc: balance = Σ holdings.marketValue (严禁 balance 与持仓相加)
            Svc->>Svc: rollNextDeductionDate(nextDeductionDate, frequency) → 下一未逾期日
            Svc->>Plan: updatePlan(nextDeductionDate=rolled, investedPeriods+1)
            Svc-->>Store: 收集 DcaDeductionResult(金额/标的)
        end
    end

    Svc-->>Store: DcaDeductionResult[]
    Store->>Store: 写入 lastDeductions; 刷新 plans/records
    Store->>Store: 联动 useInvestmentStore.fetchInvestments() + useAccountStore.fetchAccounts()
    Store-->>App: 触发提醒
    App->>App: 渲染 Snackbar「X基金 定投 ¥amount 已记录」
